{
  "name": {
    "ja": "硬い余弦追従ODE：SDIRK2",
    "en": "Stiff cosine-tracking ODE: SDIRK2"
  },
  "scope": {
    "ja": "既存のL安定2段SDIRK2でy′=−1000(y−cos t)−sin t、y(0)=1をt=1まで解く。解析解、固定刻み細分化、別の強減衰1段問題を検査。",
    "en": "Use the existing two-stage L-stable SDIRK2 for y'=-1000(y-cos(t))-sin(t), y(0)=1 up to t=1. Check its analytic solution, fixed-step refinement and a separate very stiff one-step decay."
  },
  "assumptions": {
    "ja": "rate=1000、1000/2000/4000ステップでrate*h=1,0.5,0.25。固定γ=1−1/√2と既存Newton段階解法を使用。別の減衰はy′=−10⁸y、y(0)=1、h=1。適応刻み法ではない。",
    "en": "rate=1000; 1000/2000/4000 steps give rate*h=1,0.5,0.25. Uses fixed gamma=1-1/sqrt(2) and the existing Newton stage solver. Separate decay: y'=-1e8*y, y(0)=1, h=1. No adaptive stepping."
  },
  "units": {
    "ja": "無次元時間と状態。rateの次元は逆時間、rate*hは無次元。",
    "en": "Dimensionless time/state; rate has inverse-time units and rate*h is dimensionless."
  },
  "boundaries": {
    "ja": "初期値問題で空間境界なし。終端時刻を必ず含む等間隔列。",
    "en": "Initial-value problem with no spatial boundaries; an equal-step sequence includes the final time."
  },
  "method_ids": [
    "sdirk2"
  ],
  "reading": {
    "ja": "https://hrkoyama.github.io/numerical-methods-atlas/ja/read/stiff-integration/",
    "en": "https://hrkoyama.github.io/numerical-methods-atlas/en/read/stiff-integration/"
  },
  "references": [
    {
      "type": "analytic-solution",
      "url": "https://hrkoyama.github.io/code/numerical-methods-atlas/2026-11-22/reference/stiff-cosine/result.json",
      "description": {
        "ja": "CSVは最細刻みの数値解・解析解・絶対誤差。観測次数は全時刻最大誤差から計算。旧保存例の粗格子で約1台になる挙動と、今回の解像した刻みでの次数を混同しない。",
        "en": "CSV contains finest-grid time, numerical/analytic state and absolute error. Orders use maximum-in-time errors. Distinguish the older coarse-step order reduction from the resolved refinement here."
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "analytic-solution",
      "url": "https://hrkoyama.github.io/numerical-methods-atlas/ja/read/stiff-integration/",
      "description": {
        "ja": "解析解y=cos t+(y₀−1)e^(−rate*t)。別の同次減衰も指数関数を参照。",
        "en": "Analytic y=cos(t)+(y0-1)*exp(-rate*t); the separate homogeneous decay also uses an exponential reference."
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "primary-publication",
      "url": "https://doi.org/10.1137/0714068",
      "description": {
        "ja": "既存SDIRK2項目にあるDIRKの原論文。選んだ係数・Newton設定は公開実装に固定。",
        "en": "DIRK paper already cited by the SDIRK2 record; selected coefficients/Newton settings are fixed by the released implementation."
      }
    }
  ],
  "failure_scope": {
    "ja": "方式違い、非有限入力、非正の率や刻み数、倍増でない列を拒否。Newton段階失敗は例外のまま伝える。粗い硬い刻みで一律2次収束を主張せず、今回の細分化で測定する。L安定でも正値を厳密に保つとは限らない。一般DAE・硬いPDEの検証ではない。",
    "en": "Reject other methods, nonfinite inputs, nonpositive rates/counts and non-doubling levels. Propagate implicit-stage failures. Do not claim uniform second order on coarse stiff steps; measure this supplied refinement. L-stability does not imply exact positivity. Not validation of general DAEs or stiff PDEs."
  },
  "reference_notes": {
    "ja": "CSVは最細刻みの数値解・解析解・絶対誤差。観測次数は全時刻最大誤差から計算。旧保存例の粗格子で約1台になる挙動と、今回の解像した刻みでの次数を混同しない。",
    "en": "CSV contains finest-grid time, numerical/analytic state and absolute error. Orders use maximum-in-time errors. Distinguish the older coarse-step order reduction from the resolved refinement here."
  },
